OL,3,GNEWSAWhat is Newcastle's new LMA
OL,4,Aperforming arts academy?
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new north-east of England specialist
OL,7,Fperforming arts academy for
OL,8,Fundergraduates, LMA Newcastle, opened
OL,9,Fon Monday.
OL,11,FBased on St James' Boulevard in the
OL,12,Fcity centre, it is the third campus
OL,13,Fopened by the creative institution,
OL,14,Fwhich has other sites in Liverpool and
OL,15,FLondon. The initials LMA reference the
OL,16,Facademy's history as the Liverpool
OL,17,FMedia Academy.
OL,19,FThe school's inaugural cohort is made
OL,20,Fup of 75 first-year Bachelor of Arts
OL,21,Fstudents, many of them from the North
OL,22,FEast.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
