OL,3,GNEWSAWhat is Newcastle's new LMA
OL,4,Aperforming arts academy?
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's nice to have it on our doorstep,"
OL,7,Fsaid 19-year-old Savannah Lily, from
OL,8,FJarrow, who came third in the 2021
OL,9,Fedition of The Voice Kids UK and is now
OL,10,Fstudying Music Performance at LMA.
